OL,3,GNEWSAWoman wears fancy dress every day
OL,4,Afor a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who has worn a different fancy
OL,7,Fdress outfit every day for 200 days is
OL,8,Faiming to complete a full year in
OL,9,Fcostume.
OL,11,FFor most people fancy dress is reserved
OL,12,Ffor Halloween or parties, but for Lisa
OL,13,FHughes, 52, from Farnworth, in Bolton,
OL,14,Fdressing up has become a part of her
OL,15,Feveryday routine.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
