OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWoman wears fancy dress every day
OL,4,Afor a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter having the idea at the end of
OL,7,FDecember, Lisa entered 2026 with a goal
OL,8,Fof dressing up in a different costume
OL,9,Feveryday, to raise money for charity.
OL,10,FSo far she has dressed up as Tommy
OL,11,FShelby from Peaky Blinders, Marge
OL,12,FSimpson and Cupid.
OL,14,F"I am always in fancy dress," she told
OL,15,FBBC Radio Manchester. "At first it was
OL,16,Fa bit weird, people stop me in the
OL,17,Fstreet to ask me what is going on."
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
